+ Collective Joy Course

- + Intermediate

+ Cultivate mindfulness and compassion

+ Collective Practice Course

- + Advanced

+ Establish the right view of emptiness, engage in emptiness meditation

+ Collective Virtue Course

1.3 The Two Paths of Study and Practice
The path of study and practice --- moving toward awakening (wisdom)
The path of serving the community --- realizing compassion (benefiting others)
These two paths complement each other. Study without service easily stays at the conceptual level; service without study easily loses direction.
