- + Problem

+ What to Do

- + Don't know how to use the tools

+ Bring it up during class group study, or ask your facilitator

- + Can't keep it up

+ Start with just 5 minutes a day, build the habit first, then increase the time

- + Feels like a hassle

+ The tools are meant to save you effort, not add burden. Pick 1--2 and start using them first

