7.2 Study Convention (Core Clauses)
I commit to:
1. Voluntarily join and pursue life awakening
2. Participate in study and practice with honesty, earnestness, commitment, and self-motivation
3. Not use the study and practice platform to establish commercial relationships such as lending, guaranteeing, or partnership businesses
4. Not discuss politics, social hot topics, or other unrelated matters during group study
5. Cherish the opportunity of group study; don't be late or leave early
6. Reflect on my own shortcomings; rejoice in the goodness of others
7.3 Five Don'ts
Don't post information unrelated to study and practice in the class group
Don't engage in illegal activities
Don't recruit fellow students for economic activities on the class platform
Don't discuss politics or sensitive topics of any kind
Don't use the opportunity to promote personal business training, privately divert traffic to solicit clients, or advertise paid courses
