8.3 Emergency Situations
Psychological crisis: Contact your facilitator or class leader immediately; the class will activate the care mechanism
Major life disruption: Inform the charity committee member; the class will organize care
Safety / compliance issues: Inform your facilitator; the facilitator will connect with the compliance volunteer
Conclusion
The core of this *Study Guide* is not to tell you "what you must do," but to help you discover "what you can do."
You are the master of your own study and practice. No one can awaken for you, but everyone can walk alongside you.
When you truly benefit from study and practice --- when your afflictions lessen, your wisdom grows, and your heart finds increasing peace --- you will understand: this path is worth walking.
May you not only learn wisdom at Mindful Peace Academy, but also live it; may you not only light your own inner lamp, but also help more people light theirs.
Let everyone become the master, let study and practice unfold naturally, let the flowers of awakening bloom across the world.
